# Restores the pre-decision placement of the ui task: no affinity, FreeRTOS
# chooses (docs/vm-L1-report.md sec.8 measured this as "pin_none"). The
# shipping default is core 1; this overlay and sdkconfig.uipin0.defaults are
# what reproduce the other two arms of that measurement.
#
#   idf.py -B build_uipin_off -D SDKCONFIG=build_uipin_off/sdkconfig \
#          -D "SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS=sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.uipinoff.defaults" build
CONFIG_POCKET_UI_TASK_CORE=-1
